    "For Now playing: to show what's on and play, pause or skip from the notch." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For Now playing: to show what's on and play, pause or skip from the notch."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para Sonando: para mostrar qué suena y reproducir, pausar o saltar desde el notch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For live things like scores, news or prices, Ask writes a short search from your question and sends it to DuckDuckGo (Bing if DuckDuckGo is busy), then reads the top pages it finds; for the weather, only the place goes to Open-Meteo. No cookies, no account. Answers that used the web show a globe with their sources." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For live things like scores, news or prices, Ask writes a short search from your question and sends it to DuckDuckGo (Bing if DuckDuckGo is busy), then reads the top pages it finds; for the weather, only the place goes to Open-Meteo. No cookies, no account. Answers that used the web show a globe with their sources."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para cosas en vivo como resultados, noticias o precios, Pregunta escribe una búsqueda breve a partir de tu pregunta y la envía a DuckDuckGo (o a Bing si DuckDuckGo está ocupado), y lee las primeras páginas que encuentra. Para el tiempo, solo el lugar va a Open-Meteo. Sin cookies ni cuenta. Las respuestas que usan la web muestran un globo con sus fuentes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For the Drawer: to reach the menu bar icons the notch hides, and open their menus." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For the Drawer: to reach the menu bar icons the notch hides, and open their menus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para el cajón: para llegar a los iconos de la barra de menús que esconde el notch, y abrir sus menús."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For the mirror, to check yourself before a call. The image never leaves your Mac." : {
